"Sign in" = "登录";
"Signing in opens your browser. Voice commands need an account." = "登录会打开浏览器。语音指令需要登录账户。";
"Waiting for the browser…" = "正在等浏览器完成登录…";
"Signing in isn't available in this version of VibeBuddy." = "这个版本的 VibeBuddy 还不能登录。";
"Signed in with GitHub as %@" = "已用 GitHub 账号 %@ 登录";
"Signed in with GitHub (user %lld)" = "已用 GitHub 登录（用户 %lld）";
"Signed in as %@" = "已用 %@ 登录";
"Sign out" = "退出登录";
"Delete account…" = "删除账户…";
"Delete your VibeBuddy account?" = "删除你的 VibeBuddy 账户？";
"This deletes the account and everything kept about it, and signs out on every computer. It can't be undone." = "这会删除账户和与它相关的所有数据，并在所有电脑上退出登录。删除后无法恢复。";
"Delete account" = "删除账户";
"Couldn't sign in: %@" = "登录失败：%@";
"Couldn't sign out: %@" = "退出登录失败：%@";
"Couldn't delete the account: %@" = "删除账户失败：%@";
"Voice today: %lld of %lld" = "今天的语音：已用 %lld / %lld 条";
"Today's voice is used up. It comes back at midnight UTC." = "今天的语音已用完，UTC 零点后恢复。";
"Voice is paused for everyone today. It comes back at midnight UTC." = "今天的语音已全局暂停，UTC 零点后恢复。";
"Plan" = "方案";
"Free" = "免费版";
"Paid plan" = "付费版";
"Sign in to use the Relay." = "登录后才能使用中转。";
"The Relay needs the Paid plan." = "中转需要付费版。";
"The Relay can't check the account right now. VibeBuddy tries again later." = "中转暂时无法确认账户，VibeBuddy 稍后会再试。";
"This month: %@ of %@ characters · renews %@" = "本月：已用 %@ / %@ 字符 · %@续期";

/* Own keys for spoken replies (ADR-0020) */
"Your own keys" = "自己的密钥";
"With your own key, spoken replies in that provider's voices go straight to it, billed to your account there, and never through VibeBuddy." = "填了自己的密钥后，用这家服务商声音的语音回复会直接由它合成，费用记在你在那里的账户上，不经过 VibeBuddy。";
"Volcano Engine" = "火山引擎";
"Your own key" = "自己的密钥";
"Set" = "已设置";
"Clear" = "清除";
"Get a key" = "获取密钥";
"ElevenLabs refused your own key. Replies in its voices stay silent until you set another one." = "ElevenLabs 拒绝了你自己的密钥。换一个密钥之前，用它的声音的回复不会出声。";
"Volcano Engine refused your own key. Replies in its voices stay silent until you set another one." = "火山引擎拒绝了你自己的密钥。换一个密钥之前，用它的声音的回复不会出声。";
"Couldn't save your own key: %@" = "保存自己的密钥失败：%@";

/* Making a Character (ADR-0020) */
"Make a Character…" = "创建角色…";
"Make a Character" = "创建角色";
"Start from a character, change what it says, and pick a voice. VibeBuddy makes each line in that voice, then you can write it to the box." = "从一个角色出发，改改它说的话，再挑一个声音。VibeBuddy 会用这个声音把每句台词做出来，做好后就能写进盒子。";
"Start from" = "基于";
"Name" = "名字";
"Voice" = "声音";
"Look" = "形象";
"Use %@'s look" = "用%@的形象";
"Remove this line" = "删掉这句";
"Hear this voice" = "试听这个声音";
"Stop" = "停止";
"{address} is where the buddy says what it calls you; each line with it is made once with each form of address." = "{address} 是说出对你的称呼的位置；带它的台词会按每种称呼各做一遍。";
"Make" = "创建";
"Couldn't read the lines of %@: %@" = "读不到%@的台词：%@";
"Couldn't read what was asked for this Character." = "读不到这个角色当初的设置。";
"Making “%@”… %lld of %lld" = "正在创建「%@」… %lld / %lld";
"Making…" = "创建中…";
"“%@” is made." = "「%@」创建好了。";
"Write to box" = "写进盒子";
"Resume" = "继续创建";
"Made from %@ · voice: %@" = "基于%@ · 声音：%@";
"Not finished · made from %@ · voice: %@" = "未完成 · 基于%@ · 声音：%@";
"“%@” isn't finished yet." = "「%@」还没创建完。";
"the voice's provider" = "这个声音的服务商";
"Made with your own key for %@, billed to your account there." = "用你自己的 %@ 密钥创建，费用记在你在那里的账户上。";
"Without your own key for %@, making a Character with VibeBuddy's voices needs the Paid plan." = "没有自己的 %@ 密钥时，用 VibeBuddy 的声音创建角色需要付费版。";
"Sign in on the Account tab for the Paid plan, or set your own key for %@ there." = "请在「账户」页登录以使用付费版，或在那里填上自己的 %@ 密钥。";
"Set your own key for %@ on the Account tab first." = "请先在「账户」页填上自己的 %@ 密钥。";
"Making a Character with VibeBuddy's voices needs the Paid plan, or your own key for %@." = "用 VibeBuddy 的声音创建角色需要付费版，或者自己的 %@ 密钥。";
"This month's Characters on the Paid plan are used up. The lines made so far are kept: resume next month, or with your own key for %@." = "付费版本月的创建角色额度已用完。已做好的台词会保留：下个月再继续创建，或填上自己的 %@ 密钥后继续。";
"VibeBuddy's voices are paused for today. The lines made so far are kept: resume tomorrow." = "VibeBuddy 的声音今天暂停使用。已做好的台词会保留：明天再继续创建。";
"Sign in on the Account tab, or set your own key for %@ there, then resume." = "请在「账户」页登录，或在那里填上自己的 %@ 密钥，然后继续创建。";
"%@ refused your own key. Set another one on the Account tab, then resume." = "%@ 拒绝了你自己的密钥。在「账户」页换一个，然后继续创建。";
"Making the Character stopped unexpectedly. Resume to try again." = "创建角色意外中断了。点「继续创建」再试一次。";
"Making the Character failed: %@" = "创建角色失败：%@";
"Give the Character a name of up to 64 characters." = "给角色起个名字，最多 64 个字。";
"A Character has at most 110 lines." = "一个角色最多 110 句台词。";
"Keep at least one line for “%@”." = "「%@」至少要留一句。";
"A line for “%@” is empty." = "「%@」有一句是空的。";
"Each line is one row of at most 1000 characters." = "每句台词只能占一行，最多 1000 个字。";
"Only {address} goes in braces: it is where the form of address is said." = "花括号里只能写 {address}：那是说出称呼的位置。";
