"Make your own" = "做一个自己的";
"Your drawings, your lines, a voice you pick" = "你的画、你的台词、你挑的声音";
"Bring your own drawings, pick a voice and say what it says. A character's own voice with its lines as they are is free: they are already made. Any other voice, or lines you change, VibeBuddy makes in that voice, which needs the Paid plan or your own key." = "换上你自己画的形象，挑一个声音，再定它说什么。用某个角色自己的声音、台词不改，就是免费的：这些已经做好了。换别的声音或改了台词，VibeBuddy 会用那个声音重新做每句台词，这需要付费版或你自己的 key。";
"Lines" = "台词";
"Lines from" = "台词取自";
"Free · already made" = "免费 · 已做好";
"One PNG or JPEG image: the figure four times in a 2 × 2 grid, on a plain white or transparent background. Top left normal, top right eyes closed, bottom left happy, bottom right sad. Any size: VibeBuddy cuts out each figure and makes it 48 × 64 pixels in 15 colors. No drawing yet? Copy a prompt into an image tool, such as ChatGPT or Gemini, with your character in place of the brackets." = "一张 PNG 或 JPEG 图：同一个人物画四次，排成 2 × 2，放在纯白或透明的背景上。左上正常，右上闭眼，左下开心，右下难过。尺寸不限：VibeBuddy 会抠出每个人物，做成 48 × 64 像素、15 色。还没有图？复制提示词，把方括号里换成你的角色，贴到 ChatGPT、Gemini 等生图工具里。";
"This voice and the lines are in different languages, so the lines may sound wrong." = "这个声音和台词的语言不一样，念出来可能会很怪。";
"Delete your own character? This can't be undone." = "删除你自己的角色？删除后无法恢复。";
"The box goes back to %@." = "盒子会换回 %@。";

